<opsproc code="00009069.0001001" revdate="2021-11-22T16:58:19"><title><abb>SEC</abb> 1</title><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.004"><title>Flight preparation/limitations</title><procbody lid="N.00009069.0001001.005"><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.006" memory="false"><command code="00009069.0001001.002"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.007">For performance penalties, <duref product="MMEL" ref="00022756"/>.</para></command></action></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.008"><title>During cockpit preparation</title><procdesc code="00009069.0001001.067" lid="N.00009069.0001001.131"><note code="00009069.0001001.068" layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.132"><unlist bulltype="NDASH" code="00009069.0001001.069" layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.133"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.134">If the Yellow Electric Pump
is not available:</para><item layer="1"><unlist bulltype="BULLET" code="00009069.0001001.070" layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.135"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.136">Pressurize the Yellow Hydraulic
System with:</para><item layer="1"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.137">A Ground cart,
or with</para></item><item layer="1"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.138">Both Yellow
and Green Engine Hydraulic Pumps with both Engines running.</para></item></unlist></item><item layer="1"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.139">Replace any
action on the <tech-label type="pb-sw">YELLOW ELEC PUMP</tech-label> by a similar action
on the Ground Cart or on both <tech-label type="pb-sw">GREEN ENG 1 PUMP</tech-label> and <tech-label type="pb-sw">YELLOW ENG 2 PUMP</tech-label> in the following procedure.</para></item></unlist></note></procdesc><procbody lid="N.00009069.0001001.009"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.030"><noteproc code="00009069.0001001.011" layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.031"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.032">After application of the maintenance
procedure, the <ecam-data ecamimportance="A" type="alert"><ecamsys>C/B</ecamsys><ecamtitle>TRIPPED R ELEC BAY</ecamtitle></ecam-data> and the <ecam-data ecamimportance="A" type="alert"><ecamsys>C/B</ecamsys><ecamtitle>TRIPPED ON OVHD PNL</ecamtitle></ecam-data> alerts are
displayed on the <abb>EWD</abb>.</para></noteproc></inform><inform layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.033"><para code="00009069.0001001.012" layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.034"><emph bold="false" italic="false" overline="false" sub="false" sup="false" underline="true">Check of
the elevator control and roll spoilers control through the operative
computers:</emph></para></inform><relevant-sub-proc lid="N.00009069.0001001.035"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.037"><para code="00009069.0001001.013" layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.038"><emph bold="false" italic="false" overline="false" sub="false" sup="false" underline="true">Put the aircraft in the test configuration:</emph></para></inform><relevant-sub-proc lid="N.00009069.0001001.039"><action-block lid="N.00009069.0001001.041"><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.042" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009069.0001001.014"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">YELLOW ELEC PUMP</tech-label></challenge><response>ON</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.043" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009069.0001001.015"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">PTU</tech-label></challenge><response>AUTO</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.044" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009069.0001001.016"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">BLUE ELEC PUMP</tech-label></challenge><response>AUTO</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.045" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009069.0001001.017"><challenge><tech-label type="pb">BLUE PUMP OVRD</tech-label></challenge><response>ON</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.052" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009069.0001001.023"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">ELAC 1</tech-label></challenge><response>On</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.046" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009069.0001001.018"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">ELAC 2</tech-label></challenge><response>On</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.048" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009069.0001001.020"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">SEC 2</tech-label></challenge><response>On</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.049" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009069.0001001.021"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">SEC 3</tech-label></challenge><response>On</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.050" memory="false"><command code="00009069.0001001.022"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.051">Wait <measure category="Time" show-unit="true" system="SI and derived" unit="s">5</measure></para></command></action></action-block></relevant-sub-proc><inform layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.053"><para code="00009069.0001001.024" layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.054"><emph bold="false" italic="false" overline="false" sub="false" sup="false" underline="true">Check of
the elevator control through the ELAC 1:</emph></para></inform><relevant-sub-proc lid="N.00009069.0001001.055"><action-block lid="N.00009069.0001001.056"><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.057" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009069.0001001.025"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">BLUE PUMP OVRD</tech-label></challenge><response>Off</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.058" memory="false"><command code="00009069.0001001.026"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.059">Wait for hydraulic circuit depressurization.</para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.060" memory="false"><command code="00009069.0001001.027"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.061">On the <tech-label type="s-page">F/CTL</tech-label>, check that blue elevator actuator symbol becomes amber.</para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.062" memory="false"><command code="00009069.0001001.028"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.063">Wait <measure category="Time" show-unit="true" system="SI and derived" unit="s">5</measure></para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.064" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009069.0001001.029"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">BLUE PUMP OVRD</tech-label></challenge><response>ON</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.065" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009069.0001001.030"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">ELAC 2</tech-label></challenge><response>OFF</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.066" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009069.0001001.031"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">SEC 2</tech-label></challenge><response>OFF</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.067" memory="false"><command code="00009069.0001001.032"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.068">Move the <abb>CAPT</abb> stick
from forward stop to aft stop.</para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.069" memory="false"><command code="00009069.0001001.033"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.070">On the <tech-label type="s-page">F/CTL</tech-label>, check the full travel of both elevators.</para></command></action></action-block><inform layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.075"><cautionproc code="00009069.0001001.036" layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.076"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.077">If an expected elevator
movement does not occur, do not attempt any reset.</para><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.078">Contact the maintenance.</para></cautionproc></inform></relevant-sub-proc><inform layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.079"><para code="00009069.0001001.037" layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.080"><emph bold="false" italic="false" overline="false" sub="false" sup="false" underline="true">Check of
the elevator control through the SEC 2:</emph></para></inform><relevant-sub-proc lid="N.00009069.0001001.081"><action-block lid="N.00009069.0001001.082"><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.083" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009069.0001001.038"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">ELAC 2</tech-label></challenge><response>On</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.084" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009069.0001001.039"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">SEC 2</tech-label></challenge><response>On</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.085" memory="false"><command code="00009069.0001001.040"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.086">Wait <measure category="Time" show-unit="true" system="SI and derived" unit="s">5</measure></para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.087" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009069.0001001.041"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">YELLOW ELEC PUMP</tech-label></challenge><response>Off</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.088" memory="false"><command code="00009069.0001001.042"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.089">Wait for hydraulic circuits
depressurization.</para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.090" memory="false"><command code="00009069.0001001.043"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.091">On the <tech-label type="s-page">F/CTL</tech-label>, check that the yellow and the green elevator actuators symbols
become amber.</para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.092" memory="false"><command code="00009069.0001001.044"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.093">Wait <measure category="Time" show-unit="true" system="SI and derived" unit="s">5</measure></para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.094" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009069.0001001.045"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">YELLOW ELEC PUMP</tech-label></challenge><response>ON</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.109" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009069.0001001.053"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">ELAC 1</tech-label></challenge><response>OFF</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.095" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009069.0001001.046"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">ELAC 2</tech-label></challenge><response>OFF</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.097" memory="false"><command code="00009069.0001001.048"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.098">Move the <abb>CAPT</abb> stick
from right stop to left stop, then from forward stop to aft stop.</para></command><comment code="00009069.0001001.054"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.110">Each stop must be
applied during <measure category="Time" show-unit="true" system="SI and derived" unit="s">3</measure></para></comment></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.099" memory="false"><command code="00009069.0001001.049"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.100">On the <tech-label type="s-page">F/CTL</tech-label>, check the correct movement of the pairs of spoilers 2 and 5 and
the full travel of both elevators.</para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.101" memory="false"><command code="00009069.0001001.050"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.102">Move the <abb>F/O</abb> stick
from right stop to left stop, then from forward stop to aft stop.</para></command><comment code="00009069.0001001.057"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.111">Each stop must be
applied during <measure category="Time" show-unit="true" system="SI and derived" unit="s">3</measure></para></comment></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.103" memory="false"><command code="00009069.0001001.051"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.104">On the <tech-label type="s-page">F/CTL</tech-label>, check the correct movement of the pairs of spoilers 2 and 5 and
the full travel of both elevators.</para></command></action></action-block><inform layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.105"><cautionproc code="00009069.0001001.052" layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.106"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.107">If an expected spoiler
or elevator movement does not occur, do not attempt any reset.</para><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.108">Contact the maintenance.</para></cautionproc></inform></relevant-sub-proc><inform layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.121"><para code="00009069.0001001.061" layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.122"><emph bold="false" italic="false" overline="false" sub="false" sup="false" underline="true">Return to
normal configuration:</emph></para></inform><relevant-sub-proc lid="N.00009069.0001001.124"><action-block lid="N.00009069.0001001.125"><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.126" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009069.0001001.062"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">YELLOW ELEC PUMP</tech-label></challenge><response>Off</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.127" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009069.0001001.063"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">BLUE PUMP OVRD</tech-label></challenge><response>Off</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.128" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009069.0001001.064"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">ELAC 1</tech-label></challenge><response>On</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.129" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009069.0001001.065"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">ELAC 2</tech-label></challenge><response>On</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.142" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009069.0001001.071"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">SEC 1</tech-label></challenge><response>Off</response></cr-action></action></action-block></relevant-sub-proc></relevant-sub-proc><inform layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.113"><para code="00009069.0001001.058" layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.114"><emph bold="false" italic="false" overline="false" sub="false" sup="false" underline="true">Check that
the DC TIE contactor 1 is closed:</emph></para></inform><relevant-sub-proc lid="N.00009069.0001001.115"><action-block lid="N.00009069.0001001.116"><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.117" memory="false"><command code="00009069.0001001.059"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.118">Supply the electrical network
from the <abb>APU</abb> or the external power.</para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.119" memory="false"><command code="00009069.0001001.060"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.120">On the <tech-label type="s-page">ELEC</tech-label>, check the link between the <abb>DC</abb> BUS 1 and the <abb>DC</abb> <abb>BAT</abb> BUS. </para></command></action></action-block></relevant-sub-proc></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.010"><title>In flight</title><procbody lid="N.00009069.0001001.011"><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.012" memory="false"><command code="00009069.0001001.003"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.013">Do not use the speedbrakes.</para></command></action><condition at-any-time="false" code="00009069.0001001.004" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.014" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro>If the <abb>SEC</abb> 2 and the <abb>SEC</abb> 3 fail during
the flight:</intro><procbody lid="N.00009069.0001001.016"><limit layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.023"><lit-limit lid="N.00009069.0001001.024">Autoland
is not permitted.</lit-limit></limit><limit layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.025"><lit-limit lid="N.00009069.0001001.026">Maximum
landing capability is CAT 1</lit-limit></limit><action layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.027" memory="false"><command code="00009069.0001001.009"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.028">Disengage the <abb>AP</abb> at <measure category="Altitude" show-unit="true" system="US" unit="ft">500</measure> <abb>RA</abb> before landing in direct law.</para></command><comment code="00009069.0001001.010"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009069.0001001.029">When the <abb>AP</abb> is disengaged with the three <abb>SEC</abb>s failed, it cannot be
engaged again.</para></comment></action></procbody></condition></procbody></procitem></opsproc>